# Layered on top of sdkconfig.defaults.diag by build_flash.sh --diag
# --autorun, which is how every capture of a whole self-test run is built -
# it turns the suites LAUNCHER_SELFTEST already compiled in back on for
# automatic boot-time execution, which a serial capture of SELFTEST_COMPLETE
# depends on. Ordinary interactive --diag use does NOT layer this file, so it
# keeps booting without paying the suite's wall-clock cost - see
# Kconfig.projbuild's LAUNCHER_SELFTEST_AUTORUN help text.
CONFIG_LAUNCHER_SELFTEST_AUTORUN=y
